#: resources\views\filament\app\clusters\localisations\pages\localisation-intro.blade.php:2
msgid "Survey localisation is all about making sure questions hit home with the right crowd. It’s like translating not just words, but the whole vibe of the survey. Local customs, slang, and cultural references can make or break the responses."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\clusters\localisations\pages\localisation-intro.blade.php:4
msgid "When crafting surveys, it’s crucial to consider regional differences. What works in one place might totally flop in another. Tailoring questions to fit local contexts can boost engagement and get more accurate data."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\clusters\localisations\pages\localisation-intro.blade.php:6
msgid "Testing is key. Piloting surveys in different locales helps catch any awkward phrasing or cultural missteps. Feedback from local testers can refine the survey and ensure it resonates."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\clusters\localisations\pages\localisation-intro.blade.php:9
msgid "In the end, effective survey localisation can lead to richer insights. It’s all about connecting with respondents in a way that feels natural and relevant to them."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\clusters\localisations\pages\localisation-intro.blade.php:10
msgid "Not bad for a bunch of LLM-generated nonsense, right?"
msgstr ""

