#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\monitor-data-collection.blade.php:8
msgid "This page lets you see incoming data. You can track progress and review submissions for quality assurance purposes."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\data-collection-index.blade.php:60
#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\monitor-data-collection.blade.php:12
msgid "At the top of the page, you will see a general summary of the data that has been collected; this includes the number of submissions for each form and number of farms surveyed."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\data-collection-index.blade.php:62
msgid "Beneath that, you can browse the submissions. Use the tabs to view submissions by locations at different levels, or  to simply view all of them."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\data-collection-index.blade.php:66
#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\monitor-data-collection.blade.php:18
msgid "There is also an option to download the raw data from submissions. Note that this will be unprocessed, and will not include calculated indicators; to obtain survey data ready for analysis, use the \"data analysis\" section."
msgstr ""

#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\data-collection-index.blade.php:70
#: resources\views\filament\app\pages\data-collection\monitor-data-collection.blade.php:22
msgid "If you find you need to correct an error in the data, you can directly edit a submission. This should be used sparingly, only where it has been confirmed with an enumerator that something was inputted incorrectly."
